<%
page.title = '知识图谱'
page.subtitle = '标签之间的知识联系'
page.banner_img = theme.page.banner_img
page.banner_img_height = theme.page.banner_img_height
page.banner_mask_alpha = theme.page.banner_mask_alpha
%>
<div class="container-fluid nopadding-x">
  <div class="row nomargin-x">
    <div class="col-12 nopadding-x">
      <div class="container nopadding-x-md" id="board-ctn">
        <div id="board">
          <article class="post-content mx-auto knowledge-graph-page">
            <header><small>KNOWLEDGE MAP</small><h1>标签知识图谱</h1><p>节点越大，相关文章越多；连线越粗，两个标签共同出现的次数越多。</p></header>
            <div class="knowledge-graph-toolbar"><label>筛选标签 <input type="search" data-graph-search placeholder="例如 TCP、MySQL"></label><span data-graph-status>正在加载…</span></div>
            <div class="knowledge-graph-canvas" data-knowledge-graph role="img" aria-label="博客标签关系图"></div>
            <p class="knowledge-graph-help">点击标签可进入对应标签页；拖动画布可浏览整个图谱。</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
<script src="<%- url_for('/js/knowledge-graph.js') %>" defer></script>
